<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys on-market at NZ$6.97/98.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys on-market at NZ$6.97/98.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corporation of New Zealand said on Tuesday that, as part of its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme, it had acquired 99,500 shares on market at per-share prices of NZ$6.97 and $6.98.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
</text>
